; Example input for the magic-set Sieve of Eratosthenes.
; Run:  ./run.sh            (this file)
;       ./run.sh test.mm2   (the test suite)
; Output: one (prime K) fact per prime K <= N.
; One query per run; N >= 1, an i64 literal. The default sweep budget
; (15 rounds in sieve.mm2's nextround table) covers N into the
; thousands; extend the table to go higher.

(query 10000)
